      "content": "When  installing  the  machine  tool,  the  foundation  should  be  solid.  This  ensures  the  best integrity of cutting in the machine. But, it greatly depends on the nature of ground where the factory is located, for example whether it is rocky or filled-in. Observe the general knowledge of machine tool and the related notice.",
